# LF everywhere, on every platform. Vectors and schemas are compared byte-for-byte;
# a CRLF checkout would make `pnpm vectors:check` fail on Windows clones.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wasm binary
